doc.go additions record the two things a host would otherwise have to
learn by reading the launcher:
- Workflow membership is the NodeInfo pointer alone, so a nil NodeInfo
  yields exactly the pre-attribution stream. This is the contract the
  plain-agent golden enforces.
- Inbound _adk is stripped, not echoed. A host cannot seed or spoof node
  outputs through session state or request state.

